3. Technology Stack
Technology Role in the project
Python Core language for ETL, analysis, modelling, and inventory calculations.
pandas CSV loading, cleaning, filtering, aggregation, and time-series preparation.
scikit-learn Regression estimator and model-evaluation tools, depending on the final training module.
Streamlit Interactive multi-page dashboard.
Plotly / Matplotlib / Seaborn Charts and visual exploration if imported by the dashboard or EDA modules.
joblib / pickle Common options for saving a trained model artifact; use whichever the actual training code uses.
Git and GitHub Version control, source-code hosting, and deployment source.
Streamlit Community Cloud Suggested simple hosting option for a Streamlit project.
